{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The ocean stretches endlessly. A lone boat in the distance. You follow\u2026 but it never stops moving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Edge</i> is a third-person mystery adventure set entirely on the open sea. You awaken aboard a strange vessel with no memory and no escape only the quiet hum of waves and a distant ship fading further into the horizon. As you pursue it, you\u2019ll uncover clues and piece together a story that blurs the line between reality and something far more unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why are you here? What lies beyond? And what truth awaits at the edge of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea2 <strong>Single-Environment Mystery</strong> \u2013 Explore a detailed, immersive boat environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Endless Pursuit</strong> \u2013 A second boat constantly drifts ahead. Always visible. Just out of reach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive Soundscape</strong> \u2013 A hauntingly atmospheric sound design amplifies the sense of isolation and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Unravel the Past</strong> \u2013 Piece together a deeply personal mystery as you venture deeper into unknown waters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616680?t=1744063012","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616680?t=1744063012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616680/4c6db350afad536a67571912f7a7c79e6aa009b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744063012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616680/4c6db350afad536a67571912f7a7c79e6aa009b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?